[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5689204541","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123379#issuecomment-5689204541","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123379","id":5689204541,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUxpfPQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-15T22:57:21Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T22:57:21Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5689204541/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5852917149","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123379#issuecomment-5852917149","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123379","id":5852917149,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXNxtnQ","user":{"login":"mikest","id":742517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/742517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest","html_url":"https://github.com/mikest","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-27T05:17:22Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T05:17:22Z","body":"This breaks code which uses `ClassDB.can_instantiate(some_type_string)` to determine in GDScript if a resource is abstract or not. Because ScriptServer is not exposed to scripts (which is makes script introspection very difficult) there is now no way to accomplish this (that I know of.)\r\n\r\nWould recommend rolling this back or (preferably) exposing ScriptServer functionality so that script class introspection is possible.\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15575 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15574 for use cases.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5852917149/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5853455412","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123379#issuecomment-5853455412","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123379","id":5853455412,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXOSkNA","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-27T06:38:13Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T06:42:31Z","body":"If you want to know if a script is abstract the way to do it is `Script::is_abstract` (if there is some issue with that feel free to open a report and I'll try to address it in time for 4.8). To make that work with global names `ProjectSettings::get_global_class_list` can be used (just be aware that all fields besides `path` and `class` are unreliable so not suited for e.g. code gen. For editor purposes they should be fine, it's the same data the editor resource picker uses afaik).\n\nI stand by my opinion that `ClassDB::can_instantiate(\"ScriptClassName\") == true` has to be qualified as a bug, because `ClassDB::instantiate(\"ScriptClassName\")` fails.\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5853455412/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5853535462","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123379#issuecomment-5853535462","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123379","id":5853535462,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXOXc5g","user":{"login":"mikest","id":742517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/742517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest","html_url":"https://github.com/mikest","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-27T06:51:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T06:51:44Z","body":"The change makes sense, no argument there.\r\n\r\nI guess the concern I have with Script::is_abstract is that it requires instantiating the script first. If I have a list of Resources to populate a menu with, that's a lot of creating/destroying Scripts.\r\n\r\nIn any event, I'll look into `get_global_class_list()` and see if I can get something out of that, thanks! ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5853535462/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5853664609","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123379#issuecomment-5853664609","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123379","id":5853664609,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXOfVYQ","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-27T07:10:20Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T07:10:35Z","body":"Actually `get_global_class_list` list should also include `is_abstract` based on the code, the docs seem outdated.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5853664609/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]